    <string name="onboarding_welcome_title">You woke up\n40 minutes late.</string>
    <string name="onboarding_welcome_body">Every other routine app now shows you a column of red. This one moves the rest of the day and tells you what it moved.</string>
    <string name="onboarding_before_kicker">What normally happens</string>
    <string name="onboarding_before_body">Nine alarms ring at the times you set last month. You miss six, feel behind by nine in the morning, and mute the app by Thursday.</string>
    <string name="onboarding_after_kicker">What happens here</string>
    <string name="onboarding_after_body">You say you are running late. Gym stays where it is, because it is booked. Everything hanging off it slides with you. Nothing rings for something you already did.</string>
    <string name="onboarding_point_1_title">Steps that know each other</string>
    <string name="onboarding_point_1_body">A fixed time, 20 minutes after the gym, or any time inside a window. Move one and the right ones follow.</string>
    <string name="onboarding_point_2_title">Alarms that actually wake you</string>
    <string name="onboarding_point_2_body">Full screen, rising volume, answerable from the lock screen. The app tells you if your phone is set up to stop that.</string>
    <string name="onboarding_point_3_title">Nothing leaves this phone</string>
    <string name="onboarding_point_3_body">No account, no sync, no analytics, no network permission. Your routine is one file on this device.</string>

    <string name="onboarding_start_title">What are you\ntrying to build?</string>
    <string name="onboarding_start_body">Pick the closest one. You get a real day to edit, not an empty screen, and you can change every step later.</string>
    <string name="onboarding_choice_morning_kicker">Most people start here</string>
    <string name="onboarding_choice_morning_title">A morning I do not lose</string>
    <string name="onboarding_choice_morning_body">Wake, stretch, breakfast, and a wind down that ends the day on time.</string>
    <string name="onboarding_choice_study_kicker">Exams, a course, a skill</string>
    <string name="onboarding_choice_study_title">Study that actually happens</string>
    <string name="onboarding_choice_study_body">Two deep blocks, revision, practice, and a smaller version of each for a bad day.</string>
    <string name="onboarding_choice_fitness_kicker">Training and food</string>
    <string name="onboarding_choice_fitness_title">Gym, food and sleep</string>
    <string name="onboarding_choice_fitness_body">A pinned gym slot, protein after it, a walk in the evening and a fixed lights out.</string>
    <string name="onboarding_choice_paste_kicker">Fastest if you have one</string>
    <string name="onboarding_choice_paste_title">Paste a routine from an AI chat</string>
    <string name="onboarding_choice_paste_body">Drop the text in. The app reads the times, offsets and windows, then shows you what it understood before saving.</string>
